# Containers to hide from the dashboard: one per line.
#
# A line can be a container's name, its compose service name (the "web" in myapp-web-1), or the
# first 4+ characters of its ID. Hidden containers leave the Containers table and get no
# Quick Launch tile. Lines starting with # are ignored. Changes show within a minute.
#
# Examples (remove the # to use them):
# watchtower
# a1b2c3d4
